# 48. ANTI-REPETITION SYSTEM

Do NOT make the game require constant tapping.

The player should spend most of their time:

- observing
- choosing
- upgrading
- collecting
- discovering
- decorating

NOT:

- tapping endlessly

This is an idle game, not a clicker.

