# 61. TECHNICAL PERFORMANCE

Because this is a mobile game:

DO NOT create one Update() loop per fish.

Use a centralized simulation manager.

Use:

- centralized fish simulation
- optimized flocking
- object pooling
- sprite atlas
- animation pooling
- distance-based simulation quality
- low-frequency ecosystem simulation
- optimized save system

Example:

Fish movement:

60 FPS visual interpolation

but

ecosystem calculations:

1–5 times per second

This keeps the game smooth.

