# 62. SIMULATION LEVEL OF DETAIL

Nearby fish:

Full animation

Full behavior

Full interaction

Far/hidden fish:

Reduced simulation

Very far aquarium:

Statistical simulation only

Offline:

Mathematical simulation

Do NOT simulate every fish individually while the player is offline.

